Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and their potential usage  

1. LANGUAGES."repo_name": repository identifier –‑ use to join with commits.  
2. LANGUAGES."language": VARIANT/json with language names –‑ filter repos that contain ‘Python’.  
   • Condition idea → WHERE "language"::STRING ILIKE '%Python%'  
3. SAMPLE_COMMITS."repo_name": repository identifier –‑ join to LANGUAGES.  
4. SAMPLE_COMMITS."author":"date": micro‑seconds since epoch –‑ pick commits that happened in 2016.  
   • Condition idea → BETWEEN 1451606400000000 AND 1483228799000000  (2016‑01‑01 .. 2016‑12‑31)  
5. SAMPLE_COMMITS."commit": commit hash –‑ can be counted.  

